# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SYMMIO Frontier CLI
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored). Public reads need no signer; writes do. Before
# enabling SYMMIO_PRIVATE_KEY on Unix, protect the file with `chmod 600 .env`.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Startup deployment: `arbitrum` (Enigma lowcaps, default) or `base` (Rasa
# majors). Press `x` at runtime to switch without restarting.
SYMMIO_CHAIN=arbitrum

# Optional canonical test profile. Currently applies to Arbitrum only and is
# the checked-in deployment that enables the Gasless tab. Eligible writes use
# its gasless relay without a direct-transaction fallback if the relay fails.
# This chooses the startup profile; press `e` to switch profiles at runtime.
# SYMMIO_ENVIRONMENT=staging

# Optional RPC overrides. `SYMMIO_RPC_URL` is a shared fallback; the
# chain-specific values take precedence.
# SYMMIO_ARBITRUM_RPC_URL=https://arb1.arbitrum.io/rpc
# SYMMIO_BASE_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.base.org
# SYMMIO_RPC_URL=

# Optional registered affiliate overrides. The SDK registry defaults are used
# when omitted. Do not use an arbitrary address: quotes and account-creation
# hooks depend on deployment-compatible affiliate configuration.
# SYMMIO_ARBITRUM_AFFILIATE_ADDRESS=0x...
# SYMMIO_BASE_AFFILIATE_ADDRESS=0x...
# SYMMIO_AFFILIATE_ADDRESS=0x...

# ── Identity (choose one, or neither for public read-only screens) ───────────

# A) Main-wallet private key. It signs approvals, account management,
# collateral actions, and the one-time session-key delegation.
# SECURITY: use a dedicated, low-value trading wallet. Never use a primary key.
# Signing is local: after the CLI's own confirmation, no external-wallet prompt
# appears. On Unix the CLI requires this file to deny group/world read access.
# SYMMIO_PRIVATE_KEY=0x...

# B) Read-only owner address. Ignored when SYMMIO_PRIVATE_KEY is set.
# SYMMIO_ADDRESS=0x...

# C) WalletConnect. Set a Reown project id to enable the QR path under `w`.
# The paired wallet must support Arbitrum and/or Base. A relay can be replaced
# when the default endpoint is unreachable from your region.
# SYMMIO_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=
# SYMMIO_WALLETCONNECT_RELAY_URL=wss://relay.walletconnect.org

# Session-key keystore and public gasless request journal. The directory is
# created with restrictive permissions and must remain private.
# SYMMIO_KEYSTORE_DIR=.symmio
